"104":{"hiLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/mohit-chauhan-pee-loon-english","heLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/shoshana-%D7%A9%D7%95%D7%A9%D7%A0%D7%94-shoshana.html-0","hiLyricsEn":"I will drink the dew from your blue blue eyes.\nI will drink the scale of your wet wet lips.\nI will drink, it is the season for drinking.\nWith you, love is flowing.","hiLyricsHi":"पी लूँ तेरे नीले नीले नैनों से शबनम.\nपी लूँ तेरे गीले गीले होंठों की सरगम.\nपी लूँ, है पीने का मौसम.\nतेरे संग इश्क तारी है.","heLyricsEn":"Let your light wrap all of me.\nDo whatever you do.\nLet your light, Shoshana, wrap all of me.\nDo whatever you do.","heLyricsHe":"תני לאור שלך לעטוף את כולי.\nתעשי מה תעשי.\nתני לאור שלך, שושנה, לעטוף את כולי.\nתעשי מה תעשי.","quoteEn":"He who has not sailed the sea, let him not mock the one who drowns.","quoteHi":"जो कभी समुद्र में नहीं गया, वह डूबते हुए व्यक्ति का मज़ाक न बनाए।","quoteHe":"מי שלא הפליג בים, אל נא ילעג למי שטובע.","heVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-3q7Mn_GCWs","hiVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ovR_7R9I_vI"},
"105":{"hiLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/lata-mangeshkar-dil-paagal-hai-english","heLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/%D7%90%D7%95%D7%A8-orlight.html","hiLyricsEn":"The heart is crazy, the heart is mad.\nFirst it makes you meet someone.\nThen it lights a fire in the chest.\nIt makes you laugh, and it makes you cry.","hiLyricsHi":"दिल तो पागल है, दिल दीवाना है.\nपहले करता है मुलाकात.\nफिर जलाता है सीने में आग.\nहंसाता है और रुलाता है.","heLyricsEn":"Light, can you please give me a light.\nThen the sun will return, I cannot keep shaking.\nTell me until when I cannot see.\nOh oh oh, can you please give me a light.","heLyricsHe":"אור, את יכולה לתת לי בבקשה אור.\nואז השמש תחזור, אני לא יכול יותר להמשיך לרעוד.\nתגידי לי עד מתי אני לא יכול לראות.\nאו או או, את יכולה לתת לי בבקשה אור.","quoteEn":"The fire that will burn you is the same one that once warmed you.","quoteHi":"जो आग तुम्हें जला देगी, वही आग पहले तुम्हें गर्माहट देती थी।","quoteHe":"האש שתגרום לך כוויה היא זו שחיממה אותך.","heVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O21OZkP8anw","hiVideo":"https://open.spotify.com/track/5itw0WzsobhLXyxUuAj8OQ"},
"106":{"hiLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/kuch-kuch-hota-hai-something-happens.html","heLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/%D7%90%D7%A0%D7%99-%D7%95%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%91%D7%93-%D7%A9%D7%9C%D7%99-ani-wehalevad-sheli-i-and-my-loneliness.html","hiLyricsEn":"You came near, and smiled like that.\nWho knows what dreams you showed me.\nNow my heart neither wakes nor sleeps.\nWhat can I do, something happens.","hiLyricsHi":"तुम पास आए, यूँ मुस्कुराए.\nतुमने ना जाने क्या सपने दिखाए.\nअब तो मेरा दिल जागे न सोता है.\nक्या करूँ हाय, कुछ कुछ होता है.","heLyricsEn":"So leave my heart.\nIt got used to being in pain.\nFor a long time it has loved no one.\nMe and my loneliness.","heLyricsHe":"אז תעזבי לי את הלב.\nהוא התרגל להיות כואב.\nכבר אף אחד מזמן הוא לא אוהב.\nאני והלבד שלי.","quoteEn":"Our goal is to discover the mystery of life.","quoteHi":"हमारा लक्ष्य जीवन के रहस्य की खोज करना है।","quoteHe":"מטרתנו היא לגלות את המסתורין שבחיים.","heVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2IStdcbLxiY","hiVideo":"https://open.spotify.com/track/5SBvAoJjSHEHrBdeUcOQIB"},
