"150":{"quoteEn":"No one succeeds entirely on their own.","quoteHi":"कोई पूरी तरह अकेले सफल नहीं होता।","quoteHe":"איש אינו מצליח לגמרי לבדו.","heVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XbBjdxuEbe0","hiVideo":"https://open.spotify.com/track/2jjMtTEvyuAqfGNJJiVspi","heLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/simla-kchula-%D7%A9%D7%9E%D7%9C%D7%94-%D7%9B%D7%97%D7%95%D7%9C%D7%94-blue-dress.html","hiLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/dil-ko-karaar-aaya-my-heart-peace.html","heLyricsEn":"It is you, in a blue dress, who takes my heart.\nI always wanted to know how to stop time.\nAnd only your long breaths make a little noise.\nEven if you start talking now, you do not know how to lie.","heLyricsHe":"זאת את שבשמלה כחולה לוקחת לי את הלב.\nתמיד רציתי לדעת איך עוצרים את הזמן.\nורק הנשימות הארוכות שלך עושות קצת רעש.\nגם אם תתחילי עכשיו לדבר, את לא יודעת לשקר.","hiLyricsEn":"My heart has found peace.\nI have fallen in love with you.\nO beloved.\nThis has happened to me for the first time.","hiLyricsHi":"दिल को करार आया.\nमैंने तुझको प्यार किया.\nओ सनम.\nपहली बार हुआ है ऐसा."},
"151":{"quoteEn":"Money is a simple means of transferring goods.","quoteHi":"पैसा सामान ले जाने का सरल साधन है।","quoteHe":"כסף הוא אמצעי פשוט להעברת טובין.","heVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3IILk2QjBBU","hiVideo":"https://open.spotify.com/track/02fcjwBDIojIdeB6om1xpE","heLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/achshav-%D7%A2%D7%9B%D7%A9%D7%99%D7%95-right-now.html","hiLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/lata-mangeshkar-dil-deewana-lyrics.html","heLyricsEn":"It is the heart that wakes up.\nAnd starts step by step.\nIt comes from within, you say.\nTo do, and not only talk about it.","heLyricsHe":"זה הלב שמתעורר.\nומתחיל צעד אחר צעד.\nזה בא מבפנים, אתה אומר.\nלעשות, ולא רק לדבר על זה.","hiLyricsEn":"The heart is mad, without the beloved it will not agree.\nThis mad one does not understand by being explained.\nIt beats, it sways here and there, day and night.\nThis mad one does not understand by being explained.","hiLyricsHi":"दिल दीवाना बिन सजना के माने ना.\nयह पगला है, समझाने से समझे ना.\nधक धक बोले, इत उत डोले दिन रैना.\nयह पगला है, समझाने से समझे ना."},
