"182":{"quoteEn":"Success means having the ability to do what you want.","quoteHi":"सफलता का अर्थ है जो चाहो वह कर सको।","quoteHe":"הצלחה פירושה שיהיה לך אפשרות לעשות מה שאתה רוצה.","heVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HXz70eAaiMA","hiVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oWKgpB2zpgw","heLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/ratzino-pele-we-wanted-miracle.html","hiLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/abhi-mujh-mein-kahin-still-somewhere-inside-me.html","heLyricsEn":"The day-to-day is a prison, we wanted a miracle.\nEven if for a moment we believed that it was possible.\nThe day-to-day is a prison, we wanted a miracle.\nThe temptation would appear innocent to us.","heLyricsHe":"רצינו פלא.","hiLyricsEn":"Still somewhere inside me.\nA little life is left.\nA new heartbeat woke.\nI know I am still alive.","hiLyricsHi":"अभी मुझ में कहीं.\nबाकी थोड़ी सी है ज़िन्दगी.\nजगी धड़कन नई.\nजाना ज़िंदा हूँ मैं तो अभी."},
"183":{"quoteEn":"There are no limits to the universe. You place limits on the universe with your expectations.","quoteHi":"ब्रह्मांड की कोई सीमाएँ नहीं हैं। आप अपनी अपेक्षाओं से ब्रह्मांड पर सीमाएँ लगा देते हैं।","quoteHe":"אין מגבלות ליקום. אתה מציב מגבלות ביקום עם הציפיות שלך.","cite":"Deepak Chopra","heVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ITzMQKr523Y","hiVideo":"https://open.spotify.com/track/6f3ANRNQ8nCiPZ6VqXqq93","heLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/%D7%90%D7%96-%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%AA%D7%99-so-i-left.html","hiLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/main-rahoon-ya-na-rahoon-whether-i-remain-or-not.html", "heLyricsEn":"So I walked away and returned, possessed by madness.\nCatching the train traveling south of Dimona.\nWhat are you doing to me, what are you doing to me.\nSo I walked away and returned, possessed by madness.", "heLyricsHe":"אז הלכתי.", "hiLyricsEn":"Whether I remain or not, you will stay inside me somewhere.\nIf someday the rain arrives, take it as me being in the drops.\nIf the sunrays tease you in the morning, take it as me being in the rays.\nWhether I say or not, do listen to me forever.", "hiLyricsHi":"मैं रहूँ या न रहूँ."},
