"200":{"heLyricsEn":"Listen to me, my brother, everything is here.\nGreen grass and a blue sky.\nA yellow Negev, an oasis in the desert.\nIn my opinion nothing is missing.","heLyricsHe":"תקשיב לי אחי יש פה הכל.\nדשא ירוק ורקיע כחול.\nנגב צהוב נווה במדבר.\nלפי דעתי לא חסר שום דבר.","hiLyricsEn":"These threads of attachment.\nThey tangle with your fingers.\nNo one finds a trace.\nHow do these knots untie.","hiLyricsHi":"ये मोह मोह के धागे.\nतेरी उँगलियों से जा उलझे.\nकोई टोह टोह ना लागे.\nकिस तरह गिरहा ये सुलझे.","quoteEn":"Eat what you want, but dress according to fashion.","quoteHi":"जो आप खाना चाहते हैं खाएं, लेकिन फैशन के अनुसार पहनें।","quoteHe":"אכול מה שיש ברצונך, אך התלבש בהתאם לאופנה.","heVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4mWuurhKfYM","hiVideo":"https://open.spotify.com/track/189DQylImZ1hGZaIpAQUzx","heLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/takshiv-li-achi-listen-me-my-brother.html","hiLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/ayushmann-khurrana-m%C5%8Dh-m%C5%8Dh-k%C4%93-dh%C4%81g%C4%93-lyrics.html"},
