"202":{"hiLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/agar-tum-mil-jao-if-you-get-meet.html","heLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/ahava-boeret-burning-love.html","hiLyricsEn":"If you are found.\nWe will leave the world.\nIf you are found.\nHaving found you, we will break with the whole world.","hiLyricsHi":"अगर तुम मिल जाओ.\nज़माना छोड़ देंगे हम.\nअगर तुम मिल जाओ.\nतुम्हें पाकर ज़माने भर से रिश्ता तोड़ देंगे हम.","heLyricsEn":"Burning love, and I am always burned.\nDevouring love, and I am always devoured.\nKilling love, and I am always killed.\nYes, I am never saved.","heLyricsHe":"אהבה בוערת ואני תמיד נשרף.\nאהבה טורפת ואני תמיד נטרף.\nאהבה הורגת ואני תמיד נקטל.\nכן אני אף פעם לא ניצל.","quoteEn":"The object of life is not to be on the side of the majority.","quoteHi":"जीवन का लक्ष्य बहुमत के साथ होना नहीं है।","quoteHe":"מטרת החיים אינה להיות עם הרוב.","cite":"Marcus Aurelius","heVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SpQiku3AUEY","hiVideo":"https://open.spotify.com/track/14k5ZaCWRYwXdz2FWCaQby"},
"203":{"hiLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/ae-what-life-without-you.html","heLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/lemon-tree-lemon-tree.html","hiLyricsEn":"O companion, what is life without you.\nO companion, what is life without you.\nIn the flowers, in the buds, in the lanes of dreams.\nWithout you there is nothing anywhere.","hiLyricsHi":"ओ साथी रे, तेरे बिना भी क्या जीना.\nओ साथी रे, तेरे बिना भी क्या जीना.\nफूलों में, कलियों में, सपनों की गलियों में.\nतेरे बिना कुछ कहीं ना.","heLyricsEn":"Suddenly the fruit fell on me.\nLucky it did not kill me.\nThe lemon tree has heavy fruit.\nThe lemon tree has heavy fruit.","heLyricsHe":"פתאום נפל עלי הפרי.\nמזל שזה לא הרג אותי.\nפירות כבדים יש ללמון טרי.\nפירות כבדים יש ללמון טרי.","quoteEn":"Never value anything as profitable that compels you to break your promise.","quoteHi":"जो वचन तोड़वाए उसे लाभ मत मानो।","quoteHe":"אל תחשיב לרווח דבר שמכריח אותך להפר הבטחה.","cite":"Marcus Aurelius","heVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y6w_lv6WVgY","hiVideo":"https://open.spotify.com/track/6V02gm33UVBuwK9ZUfxkDw"},
"204":{"hiLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/mohit-chauhan-pee-loon-english","heLyrics":"https://lyricstranslate.com/en/%D7%90%D7%AA%D7%94-%D7%91%D7%A1%D7%98%D7%9C%D7%94-ata-bestalah.html","hiLyricsEn":"I will drink the dew from your blue blue eyes.\nI will drink the scale of your wet wet lips.\nI will drink, it is the season to drink.\nWith you love is a thread.","hiLyricsHi":"पी लूँ तेरे नीले नीले नैनों से शबनम.\nपी लूँ तेरे गीले गीले होंठों की सरगम.\nपी लूँ है पीने का मौसम.\nतेरे संग इश्क़ तारी है.","heLyricsEn":"All the stoned ones drop more heads.\nLook right and left so no detectives pop up.\nGrab a good corner right between the bushes.\nAfter a few heads life is suddenly beautiful.","heLyricsHe":"כל הסטלנים תפילו עוד ראשים.\nסתכלו ימין ושמאל שלא יצוצו בלשים.\nתפסו לכם פינה טובה ממש בין השיחים.\nאחרי כמה ראשים החיים פתאום יפים.","quoteEn":"How much more grievous are the consequences of anger than the causes of it.","quoteHi":"क्रोध के परिणाम उसके कारण से भारी होते हैं।","quoteHe":"תוצאות הכעס כבדות מסיבותיו.","cite":"Marcus Aurelius","heVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MIrbipsEKx0","hiVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ovR_7R9I_vI"},
